{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund more pet-friendly homeless shelters",
        "additional_details": "Animals can provide vital emotional support, companionship, safety and stability. People fleeing abuse, homelessness or unsafe homes should not have to choose between a safe home and the animal they depend on. Separation can cause devastating distress.",
        "background": "I want the Government to fund more pet-friendly homeless shelters so vulnerable people aren\u2019t forced to give up animals to access safe accommodation. Councils should provide or consider pet-friendly housing, recognising animals can provide vital emotional support, safety and stability.",
